# Observed DES Y3 joint-data demonstration; estimator/source/scale-cut and Gaussian-likelihood approximations prevent a publication-reproduction claim.
# These observed unblinded files are paired by the pinned upstream joint NLA configuration, recorded in data/y3_observed_manifest.yaml. This demonstration does not reproduce its cuts, compression, calibrated source treatment or Percival likelihood.
# All 400 xi and 80 Map3 rows are retained. Small-scale baryonic contamination, exact finite-SAS estimator agreement and connected IA covariance changes are not validated by this demonstration.
# The likelihood is a normalized fixed Gaussian with the complete joint cross-covariance. It applies no Hartlap, Percival or PME correction and no MOPED compression.
# Source clipping and normalization follow the explicitly recorded demonstration source file. These processed curves are not a calibrated replacement for the published source model.
# Uniform cosmological and IA ranges below are demonstration priors. In particular sigma8 is sampled uniformly, unlike a uniform S8 prior in the published inference.
# Gaussian source-calibration widths and means follow 2503.03964 Table 3; finite bounds explicitly truncate and renormalize each Gaussian prior.
# Flat dark energy w0=-1,wa=0 and mnu=0.06 eV are fixed. Ct and the bispectrum-only feedback fb remain fixed at zero.
# A short --check evaluates the fiducial probability; it does not establish numerical convergence or a converged posterior.

two_point_file = upstream_y3_observed/data/dv/real_2pt_desy3_unblind_g2flip_matchElisa_2025Mar10.fits
aperture_file = upstream_y3_observed/data/dv/real_map3_desy3_unblind_scalecut3pcf_796simcov_2025Mar11.fits
cov_file = upstream_y3_observed/data/covariance/xip_xim_map3_covariance_8ARCMINCUT_25Feb25.fits
nz_source_file = demonstration/y3_demo_sources.fits
source_ntomo = 4
data_file =
mask_file =
compression_file =
mock_count = 0
parameter_count = 0
